  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be a vector in the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>- plane making an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with the positive <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis and&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is the geometric mean of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vBQDa",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "icoLb",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
